From beb5414e703db94f18901a7e26b6cd8862286c70 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 15 May 2026 14:02:31 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add Inventering tab for timed dragonfly field surveys
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

5-step wizard: start → location (draggable map) → species list
(add/remove) → 15-min timed counting session → report. Reports
are persisted locally via AsyncStorage and accessible from
Mer → Inventeringsrapporter. GPS position pre-populates the species
checklist from the existing grid_cells data.

https://claude.ai/code/session_017qmWfahVEirZBvVSLZZVkV
